question:
What is the output of the following hierarchy constructor program?
```java
class Grandparent {
    Grandparent() {
        System.out.print("G ");
    }
}
class Parent extends Grandparent {
    Parent() {
        System.out.print("P ");
    }
}
class Child extends Parent {
    Child() {
        System.out.print("C ");
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new Child();
    }
}
```

