What is the output of the following instanceof verification program?
```java
class Alpha {}
class Beta extends Alpha {}
class Gamma extends Beta {}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Alpha obj = new Gamma();
        boolean b1 = obj instanceof Alpha;
        boolean b2 = obj instanceof Beta;
        boolean b3 = obj instanceof Object;
        System.out.println(b1 + "," + b2 + "," + b3);
    }
}
```

What is the output of the following shadow variable hierarchy program?
```java
class SuperUnit {
    int code = 100;
}
class SubUnit extends SuperUnit {
    int code = 200;
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        SuperUnit unit = new SubUnit();
        System.out.println(unit.code);
    }
}
```

What is the output of the following program?
```java
class Top {
    int val;
    Top() {
        val = 1;
    }
}
class Bottom extends Top {
    Bottom() {
        super();
        val += 2;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Bottom b = new Bottom();
        System.out.println(b.val);
    }
}
```
